    "$t": "潤餅kauh"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>作者：</b></span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>張瀠文</b></span></p><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEg4TdEx4-jz8Kw3bj8a6ko9u9JauQ6idWLCkItE6gJDM8D6M3zArRLa6vjaGalejOqX46ryiAHk5MAyve7roUweRjdhLQZk_xxc3uy7HDE3O3P77b-Dl8wyTeD0bIawMdr4hwldhpCak0VFHXhSxHpLCrQjTm7jmszKW7rM-mBXeW0HFT1VoPuWwMa8N5ZV/s4080/PXL_20240407_151641034.MP.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1855\" data-original-width=\"4080\" height=\"290\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEg4TdEx4-jz8Kw3bj8a6ko9u9JauQ6idWLCkItE6gJDM8D6M3zArRLa6vjaGalejOqX46ryiAHk5MAyve7roUweRjdhLQZk_xxc3uy7HDE3O3P77b-Dl8wyTeD0bIawMdr4hwldhpCak0VFHXhSxHpLCrQjTm7jmszKW7rM-mBXeW0HFT1VoPuWwMa8N5ZV/w640-h290/PXL_20240407_151641034.MP.jpg\" width=\"640\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEghbZtHMKfOCCYqgJ-ncmVS1l4YZM2DaCOfRRBf-BnwZQ8xEPmR2UC1PceywdR4nLUAsvsjk_YkishyU0CwUDPFRhyphenhyphenYn9cG9epwdJrIPkdrJd18v8ZNCWHOQ6fAMRtlcm2xuHs6psgWizxS2Ktj8GSaL8plCFsqout8IiJpBUgAQAZ0dSzT3Uzpo2Wc_2uf/s4080/PXL_20240407_152133978.MP.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3072\" data-original-width=\"4080\" height=\"482\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEghbZtHMKfOCCYqgJ-ncmVS1l4YZM2DaCOfRRBf-BnwZQ8xEPmR2UC1PceywdR4nLUAsvsjk_YkishyU0CwUDPFRhyphenhyphenYn9cG9epwdJrIPkdrJd18v8ZNCWHOQ6fAMRtlcm2xuHs6psgWizxS2Ktj8GSaL8plCFsqout8IiJpBUgAQAZ0dSzT3Uzpo2Wc_2uf/w640-h482/PXL_20240407_152133978.MP.jpg\" width=\"640\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">細漢時，厝--裡有一站tiānn-tiānn食潤餅kauh，規家伙仔做伙tshuân料，tsiânn做心適ê記持。來美國以後，幾若冬無食--ah，kan-tann大漢查某囝出世以後hit冬，有朋友來阮兜tshuân hōo阮食。今年有媽媽tàu-sann-kāng做潤餅kauh，tsiânn成功，阮一喙咬--落-去kiōng-beh流目屎。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">我今年ê心得，潤餅kauh ê味上重要--ê是ài有摻糖ê塗豆仁hu、蒜茸、豬肉外口ê胡椒鹽。Tsit三味kap做伙，真正是suà喙ê好滋味！講是án-ne講，m̄-kú其實逐項料lóng tsiok重要，全部摻做伙tsiah是阮記持內底ê味。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span></span></p><a name='more'></a><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span><p></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">食譜</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">●<span style=\"white-space: pre;\">\t</span>豬肉：Kā水hiânn hōo滾，規塊豬肉囥--入-去，水ài ē-tàng淹過hit塊肉。等水滾，用勻勻仔火，時間看肉大細塊，滾十thóng分，差不多ê時kā箸插--入-去；若是插ē入--去而且無血流--出-來，就kā火tsūn hōo hua，koh浸差不多十分鐘左右就好--ah。Kā肉提出來囥hōo涼，抹胡椒鹽，切做片。（豬肉ê部位看家己ê口味，媽媽tī台灣用niáu鼠仔肉，我tsit擺用tenderloin〈腰內肉〉，bē-bái。）</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">●<span style=\"white-space: pre;\">\t</span>刺瓜仔：削皮，切長長一條一條，子挖--起-來。（M̄知刺瓜仔tī美國kám揣有，mā m̄知英文名號做啥，tsit擺用khah有刺ê瓜仔nî〈Kirby cucumber〉。）</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">下底ê料用仝一塊鼎，除了卵lóng m̄免淋油。卵代先落-去，koh來是豆乾，其他--ê順序lóng ē-sái。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">●<span style=\"white-space: pre;\">\t</span>卵絲：煎卵皮切做絲。卵lā hōo tsiâu勻，suah一屑仔鹽kah胡椒粉，lā-lā--leh。用平底鼎煎。倒薄薄一層卵汁，搖鼎hōo規塊鼎lóng有卵汁。（Án-ne煎--起-來khah薄mā khah好píng--過。）</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">●<span style=\"white-space: pre;\">\t</span>豆乾：切薄薄一片一片，鋪tī鼎底，豆油掖--一-輾，糖me一屑屑仔掖--落-去，炒炒--leh。試鹹tsiánn，味若無夠，就koh淋一擺豆油kah糖。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">菜蔬lóng是hē tī鼎內炒炒--leh，m̄好sionn熟。味用一屑仔鹽kah胡椒就好。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">●<span style=\"white-space: pre;\">\t</span>Li̋n-jín（紅菜頭）：切做絲。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">●<span style=\"white-space: pre;\">\t</span>芹菜：切做芹菜珠仔。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">●<span style=\"white-space: pre;\">\t</span>高麗菜：切做絲。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">●<span style=\"white-space: pre;\">\t</span>豆菜：用綠豆仔芽，洗洗--leh，直接炒。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">●<span style=\"white-space: pre;\">\t</span>皇帝豆：Peh皮，剝做兩瓣，炊iah是sa̍h。（Tsit擺用罐頭ê Green lima beans，口感sionn爛，m̄-kú味有成。）</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">●<span style=\"white-space: pre;\">\t</span>塗豆仁hu摻糖：糖用赤砂khah好。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">●<span style=\"white-space: pre;\">\t</span>蒜頭磨做蒜茸。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">●<span style=\"white-space: pre;\">\t</span>胡椒lóng是用白胡椒粉。&nbsp;</span></p><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div></div><!--more--><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEi-83tAueLlWnI9eCYI0ea4xu1mLDBAj0Bj5dFXBPJ0TvCFZBTMhRMmGMCJScywz7uqugcK46CaPX-QXrSVcSI5lM0YF6vxgZuZCm4-GKn8HEZY-7HTtbyATqnkaEeEIhvwZXZGxg1dmQ1V_iBTEsx80m0S3b27ztuJU38wNsFdniVo9cu5KFHHF8TFQWHT/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1364%E6%9C%9F_25.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEi-83tAueLlWnI9eCYI0ea4xu1mLDBAj0Bj5dFXBPJ0TvCFZBTMhRMmGMCJScywz7uqugcK46CaPX-QXrSVcSI5lM0YF6vxgZuZCm4-GKn8HEZY-7HTtbyATqnkaEeEIhvwZXZGxg1dmQ1V_iBTEsx80m0S3b27ztuJU38wNsFdniVo9cu5KFHHF8TFQWHT/w454-h640/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1364%E6%9C%9F_25.jpg\" width=\"454\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgP1pq3v_6WA1pP4ZkdwonmQmv-dhKLSMrCXAwbaqBIV0gtvFlfIdezy5jNAtr_bUbAApsMAq-U-MceLNHkA4mUH2w5HmC0xRb1P91e3VEKrgIdsPNKCvc4H8-_v-Bpn5efFH4IunaCkvtYR2wxBW4poSeZ7Ggrlw51eXY6BL_DtGFOUNnH0uu3FPfqA-M4/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1364%E6%9C%9F_26.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgP1pq3v_6WA1pP4ZkdwonmQmv-dhKL